    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-19-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is the reason for creating an AutoMLConfig?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>It is where the training and the testing data are split</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>It is where you specify the model to be trained</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>It provides all the details of your AutoML experiment</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
